# Production no longer uses a plaintext app .env file.
#
# The app loads its typed secret set through the Monosecret Rust SDK from one
# 1Password item, `monochange.dev` in the `monochange` vault. Docker Compose
# injects only the bootstrap 1Password service account token as a Docker
# secret from:
#
#   /opt/monochange/secrets/op_service_account_token
#
# See README.md in this directory for the deployment flow.
